    {
      "at_ms": 22046,
      "text": "Tech Support has the most open tickets, and Noah Rhodes is on call for them. For forgotten passwords, send people to KB-0001.\n\n- **Busiest team:** Technical Support (TM-002) has 59 tickets with status \"open\". Billing has 52, Shipping and Logistics 47, Account Management about 23, and Escalations 17. These counts cover status \"open\" only. I didn't count new or pending tickets.\n- **On call for Technical Support:** Noah Rhodes (A-0002), a lead. This comes from the team's on-call field.\n- **Forgotten-password article:** KB-0001, \"How to reset your password\". It's published, in the account category. It says to choose \"Forgot password\" on the sign-in page and that the emailed reset link is valid for one hour. It also says to check spam and confirm the address on file if nothing arrives.\n\nSeveral open Tech Support tickets are \"Cannot log in after password reset\". For those customers KB-0001 probably won't help, because they already have the reset link."
    }
